                                    <span class="psc-calc-result" style="color:var(--ex-accent);">0.51 lots</span>
                                </div>
                                <div style="font-size:12px;color:#64748b;padding:8px 20px 14px;background:#f8fafc;">*Pip value for GBP/JPY varies with the USD/JPY rate. Always verify with your broker's calculator.</div>
                            </div>

